'''''A Knight Stranger''''' is a [[Companion Mission]] in the chapter [[Outworld Sojourner (Companion Mission Chapter)|Outworld Sojourner]].

==Steps==
# Speak with Dahao at the Realm-Keeping Commission
# Speak with Jingyan and check the video recording the cycrane took
# Talk to Jingyan and confirm her new finding
# Find Yinshu, the shopkeeper of Spare Time Book Shop, at the Exalting Sanctum
# Find clues about Yinshu around Spare Time Book Shop
# Find Yinshu at the Exalting Sanctum and talk to her
# Return to the Realm-Keeping Commission and learn about the new clues of the case from Jingyan
# Collaborate with March 7th to put on her detective show
# Leave the Realm-Keeping Commission and check out the "scene of the crime"
# Listen to what Jingyan is telling Back'n and Forth

