===Speak with Dahao at the Realm-Keeping Commission{{subst:void|<!--202030702-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Realm-Keeping Commission Chancery|update|After the Stellaron Crisis outbreak, the six commissions were busy as a bee trying to find the perpetrator in vain. Official Dahao of the Realm-Keeping Commission requested support from the Astral Express to identify suspects. Sounds like another bothersome case... However, as a Nameless, you should lend a helping hand as much as you can. Go talk to him.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to Dahao)
:'''Guangjin:''' Hey, (Trailblazer). It's been a while.
:'''Guangjin:''' I've documented the previous operations to capture the Trotters. The report can be accessed and reviewed at any time.
:'''Guangjin:''' Would you like to re-visit them?
:Let me re-visit the previous operations.
:'''Guangjin:''' No problem. Please wait while I apply for access permission. By the way, this is historical information, which does not generate any operation payment.
:'''Guangjin:''' Are you sure you want to re-visit the previous operations, (Trailblazer)?
:Let's begin.
:'''Guangjin:''' Sure. As the info is complete, you'll be guaranteed an immersive experience.
:Forget it.
:'''Guangjin:''' Alright. Since you've helped the Realm-Keeping Commission on many occasions, you are welcome to access our operation archives any time.
:Maybe next time.
:'''Guangjin:''' Alright. Since you've helped the Realm-Keeping Commission on many occasions, you are welcome to access our operation archives any time.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I'm here to help with the investigation.
:'''Dahao:''' Oh, so you are. And these would be... Miss March 7th and Mr. Yang, I presume?
:{{tx}}
:{{tx}}
:{{tx}}
----
:'''March 7th:''' ...What's wrong, Mr. Yang? See anything fishy?
:'''Welt:''' Who's he? ...I'd like to see more information on him.
:'''Dahao:''' Which one? Let me see...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} ...What's wrong, Mr. Yang? See anything fishy?
::'''March 7th:''' ...I thought we talked about copying people.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Is one of them a threat?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Let's kick some butt so we can get back to resting.
::'''March 7th:''' Resting? Booooring!
:'''Welt:''' I don't have any concrete evidence... but I think he's worth checking out.
:'''Dahao:''' Oh, him? I remember him. He's a traveling merchant. He trades throughout the universe, knows a thing or two about remedial arts too. He registered himself on the Xianzhou as... what was it again...
:'''Jingyan:''' Luocha. His name is Luocha.
:'''Dahao:''' That's right, Luocha. He came to the Xianzhou with a huge box this time &mdash; some sort of funerary contraption. It had a funny name... something to do with coughing? It was pretty conspicuous &mdash; I had to ask him about it.
:'''Jingyan:''' "Coffin." It's a tool that certain non-Xianzhou travelers seem to use in death rites... I'm guessing our guests here might recognize it.
:'''Dahao:''' Hmph, I swear he said "coughing"... Anyway, we checked him out &mdash; his record on the Xianzhou is squeaky-clean. As for this "caffeine" thing...
:'''Jingyan:''' Coffin.
:'''Dahao:''' Yeah, yeah. Either way, it definitely had something to do with funerals. There are lots of travelers on the Luofu, each with their own star system and death rites &mdash; I guess that must be Luocha's line of work... Is there something up with him?
:'''Welt:''' Not necessarily... but I have my reasons for wanting to investigate. What was he doing in the days leading up to the Ambrosial Arbor's resurrection?
:'''Dahao:''' Hmm... that's complicated. Come with me to the Foursquare Mirror &mdash; it'll be easier to explain.
----
:'''Dahao:''' Exalting Sanctum is one of the Luofu's crucial central cities &mdash; the higher-ups are very concerned about security issues here. That's why there are so many cycranes stationed in the area.
:'''Dahao:''' Luocha arrived on the Luofu a few days prior to the Ambrosial Arbor's resurrection. Up until the day before the resurrection, there was nothing suspicious about his behavior...
:'''March 7th:''' I figured it out! The day before the resurrection, he appeared near the Ambrosial Arbor with a Stellaron!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} The Realm-Keeping Commission would have arrested him by now...
::'''March 7th:''' Oh yeah, I guess. You're pretty smart... sometimes.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Eureka! That solves everything!
::'''Welt:''' If that were the case, the Realm-Keeping Commission would have arrested him by now &mdash; why look to us for help?
::'''March 7th:''' Oh, yeah... Ah Geez, this is gonna be a tough case to crack if even my instincts are off...
:'''Dahao:''' Hahahaha, you lot are enthusiastic, I'll give you that. The reason I mention the day before the resurrection is because... we have no idea what he did that day.
:'''Dahao:''' The resurrection brought about unusual yinyang phenomena that caused the entire cycrane system to malfunction. The image data from the day of the incident is beyond restoration, and data from the day before was badly affected.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Why don't you just ask him?
:'''Dahao:''' We will, in due course. But we can't be too general &mdash; specific questions are key. Not to mention, without a clear suspicion, it would involve multiple interrogations...
:'''Dahao:''' So... if you feel this Luocha is suspicious in some way, make it known. Then I can arrange for his detention and interrogation.
:'''Welt:''' How should I put this... He just looks kind of...
:'''March 7th:''' Mr. Yang! You were going off his appearance this whole time? I thought you had some super secret thing up your sleeve! Didn't your mom ever tell you not to judge a book by its&mdash;
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} &mdash;Cover!?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} His appearance? He looks pretty handsome to me...
::'''March 7th:''' Exactly! ...Huh? W&mdash;Wait! That's not the point!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Yup, he just rubs me the wrong way!
::'''March 7th:''' Where's this anger coming from?
:'''Welt:''' Sorry, what I mean is... hmm. It's difficult to explain, but my instinct tells me this Luocha is involved somehow.
:'''Welt:''' Apologies, I realize this is personal speculation.
:'''Dahao:''' That's alright &mdash; instinct is an important part of any Realm-Keeping Commission investigation. There are times when my gut tells me something's not right, and there's usually a reason for it. I'm with you on this one.
:'''Dahao:''' Be that as it may, as an official, I can't go bringing someone in based on a villainous appearance...
:'''Jingyan:''' ...Because if a complaint led to his dismissal, it would leave a blemish on his resume, making it difficult for him to advance his career for the next few centuries.
:'''Dahao:''' Precise&mdash; No! What are you talking about... Anyway, if you do want to investigate, I can grant you access to the Foursquare Mirror... Jingyan, you'll be assisting our esteemed guests in their investigation.
:'''Jingyan:''' Isn't it inappropriate for an officer of the Realm-Keeping Commission to assist the public in investigating someone?
:'''Dahao:''' Bah, not at all... Make sure you don't leave the Commission &mdash; just help them check the cycrane footage.
:'''Dahao:''' Keep me updated on progress &mdash; if you find hard evidence, I'll be there in a flash. One thing though &mdash; don't approach him. If you make a discovery, contact me first.
:'''Welt:''' We're thankful that you're entrusting this to us &mdash; we'll keep it by the book.
:'''March 7th:''' Don't worry, the Express Crew keeps its promises. We won't disappoint you.
:'''Dahao:''' *sigh* Jingyan, over to you. I need to get going.
:'''Jingyan:''' Understood.
:'''Jingyan:''' This might take you some time. Come and find me when you're ready.
----
{{Dialogue End}}

===Speak with Jingyan and check the video recording the cycrane took{{subst:void|<!--202030703-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Realm-Keeping Commission Chancery|update|In the process of helping the Realm-Keeping Commission in identifying suspects, something unexpected happened. The Realm-Keeping Commission isn't too anxious about it, but Welt was. The moment he saw Luocha's flawless face, he was stunned and cold sweat drenched his shirt. You don't know the reason, but Welt must have a good reason for being so unnerved. Continue to investigate this Mr. Luocha.<br />Say, what is March 7th so excited about, and since when did she have a "Genius Detective" tacked onto her name?}}
{{Dialogue Start}}


;(Talk to March 7th)
:'''March 7th:''' Hoo-wee! We may be new to the Xianzhou, but we're already investigating the mysterious disappearance of Luocha...
